	(descr "NXP Semiconductors SW3639 NTAG I2C plus Class 4 printed antenna, source package 54X27_3TURNS_THIN. Nominal 54 x 27 mm, 3 turns, 0.30 mm trace and 0.95 mm gap. ANT1 to LA; ANT2 to LB. Internal plated holes and bottom crossover belong to ANT2; net tie models the intentional DC-continuous coil. Source copper, mask and drill geometry preserved; no stencil paste or assembled component. Maintain RF clearance and tune on the final PCB. https://www.nxp.com/webapp/Download?colCode=SW3639")
